    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46130" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">subter-dūco</span></b> , xi, 3,
			v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to carry off secretly</i>, <i>to steal
				away</i> any thing (Plautin.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ne tibi clam se subterducat istinc,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Mil. 2, 3, 72</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">si huic occasioni tempus sese subterduxerit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					As. 2, 2, 12</span></i>
			.</div>
